      "side": 1,
      "message": "Setting pending_args \u003d NULL after host_send_response() races with incoming host command interrupts: once pkt0-\u003esend_response() signals the host inside host_send_response(), an ISR can immediately call host_command_received() and set pending_args \u003d args before line 437 runs, causing line 437 to clear the new pending_args and drop the command. Consider removing pending_args \u003d NULL here (or latching pending_args into a local variable and clearing it before calling host_send_response()).",
      "revId": "93febeb2636d445acfe9d86d9918c1ae500d7434",
